 R←Test_UC_024(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;rc;msg;buff;stop
⍝ Runs ]ShowLastVersionInIndex - the user command, not just the API function.
⍝ Note that there was no test at all for this command, which is why nobody noticed that its
⍝ user command function was missing altogether; see GitHub issue 19.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 stop←0
 (rc msg buff)←stop ∆UCMD'ShowLastVersionInIndex APLSource/Counter.aplf -project="',∆Folder4,'"'
 msg Assert rc=0
 →T.PassesIf 0=≢msg
 →T.PassesIf∨/' r←3'⍷∊buff

 (rc msg buff)←stop ∆UCMD'ShowLastVersionInIndex Counter -project=#.Proj_4'
 msg Assert rc=0
 →T.PassesIf∨/' r←3'⍷∊buff

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
